+# Current H41 worker readiness
+
+Worker status: ready for coordinator integration. Overall status: partial, with full validation pending coordinator merge. Delivery: coordinator-pending, exactly as H41 directs, although the coordinator reports pulling and hash-verifying the retained pack. No cache-import completion is asserted.
+
+Questions H35CACHE and QREG are resolved. Never run ship-cache.sh on this VM again. Do not edit shared roots. No additional worker scope, replacement goal, source model, producer interface or validation exclusion is introduced.
+
+Work/backfill status:
+- Exact input/interface/control inventory: complete as worker work.
+- Actual Source initialization/capture and reached-machine facts for both pipelines: complete.
+- Intrinsic constructor/create, exact frame/address and independent concrete ssNew_body: complete for the reserved case.
+- Conditional consumption of existing CreationPremises.creation: checked; real admission/origin/runtime/restoration remain external duties.
+- Static refusal, timeout, wrong-order n!=7, n0/max/7 and same-case nondefault-initialized backfill: complete.
+- All28 exact standard axiom pins and explicit inventory, fresh VM build/kernel/compiler controls: pass; retained H35 evidence.
+- Separate finder/skeptic reviews and cache byte/mapping verification: accepted.
+- Worker cache pack preparation/path/SHA retention: complete; pack unchanged.
+- Delivery and required combined/full validation: coordinator-pending / pending coordinator merge; neither is recorded as passed.
+
+The exact receipt and verbatim decisions are in coordinator-receipt.json. The historical failed shipping/root checks remain intact in their original supplements and immutable archives. The current acceptance result updates policy/status only and preserves every proof/control check. No new Lean compilation is warranted by these receipt/documentation changes.
+
+The final current packet is sealed under h41/artifacts/ from its reviewed committed payload; the manifest names that payload commit and exact base. The subsequent artifact commit is identified in CLOUDVM-RESULT. Original artifacts/ and H35 checksums remain unchanged.
